sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User (Ilyass)
    participant CA as ClientApp (view)
    participant CC as ChatClient (model)
    participant SS as ServerSocket
    participant H as ClientHandler<br/>(virtual thread)
    participant CS as ChatServer
    participant O as Other clients

    U->>CA: types username, JOIN
    CA->>CC: connect(ip, port, "Ilyass")
    CC->>SS: new Socket(ip, port)
    SS-->>CS: accept() returns socketForClient
    CS->>H: Thread.ofVirtual().start(handler)
    CC->>H: writeUTF("Ilyass")
    H->>CS: register(handler, "Ilyass")
    H-->>CC: writeUTF("Welcome Ilyass!")
    Note over CC: listener thread loops on readUTF()

    U->>CA: "hi" + SEND / Enter
    CA->>CC: send("hi")
    CC->>H: writeUTF("hi")
    H->>CS: broadcast("[14:05] Ilyass: hi")
    CS-->>CC: writeUTF(...)
    CS-->>O: writeUTF(...)

    U->>CA: "allUsers"
    CC->>H: writeUTF("allUsers")
    H-->>CC: "Active users: Ilyass, Sara" (only this client)

    U->>CA: LEAVE (or "bye" / "end")
    CC->>H: writeUTF("bye")
    CC->>CC: socket.close()
    H->>CS: unregister(handler)
    CS-->>O: "<< Ilyass left the chat"
